{"nodes": [{"id": "recovered_prediction_k_half_prediction_k_half", "label": "PREDICTION-K-HALF: k = 1/2 and the centrifugal gate as domain edge", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-K-HALF.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "M ruled that item 6's l(l+1)/2 coincidence is what answers item 2, what sets k."}, {"id": "recovered_prediction_k_half_r_1449_timing_flag", "label": "R 1449 timing flag: a prediction filed before any row is read, contaminated clauses declared", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-K-HALF.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Formed after reading three binned values, so P-1 is declared CONTAMINATED while P-2 and P-3 are clean; the flag exists so a post-hoc clause can never pass as a prediction."}, {"id": "recovered_prediction_k_half_k_exactly_one_half_hypothesis", "label": "delta_0 - delta_l = k l(l+1)/2 with k = 1/2 exactly, hence alpha(l) = (l+1)/2", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-K-HALF.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "If it holds, the defect telescope carries no fitted parameter; the stated falsifier returns k to a fitted constant."}, {"id": "recovered_prediction_k_half_kgate_py", "label": "kgate.py (sealed-data-only scoring instrument, no solves)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-K-HALF.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "recovered_prediction_k_half_centrifugal_gate_as_domain_edge", "label": "The R 1255 / PD-4 centrifugal gate (l >= l_core + 2) as the law's domain edge", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-K-HALF.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "capture